          "flag": {
            "claim_id": "c-e527d741eac628ba80a9",
            "reason": "The statement attributes the event to Alonso de Contreras in 1602, but the source text does not mention this specific individual or the year 1602. The source text discusses Phournoi as a refuge for pirates but does not provide a specific date or name for the event described in the statement. The statement's details are not explicitly supported by the source text.",
