        "exact_excerpt": "\nIn the summer of 1602, the Spanish pirate Alonso de Contreras sought refuge on the deserted islands\nof Phournoi with his Maltese frigate and companions, following a series of successful operations in Serifos,\n­Astypalaia, Amorgos and Patmos, intending to regroup and divide their spoils.",
